<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"><title>Editor workspace · Kabita Live</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/editor-workspace.css"><script type="module" src="assets/editor-workspace.mjs"></script></head><body>
<a class="skip" href="#canvas">Skip to page editor</a><header><a class="brand" href="index.html">Kabita Live</a><span>Editor Studio</span><span class="badge">Private edition workspace</span><button type="button" id="cloud-login" disabled>Sign in with Google</button><button id="studio-home" type="button" hidden>Dashboard</button><span id="header-account" hidden>Signed in</span></header>
<div class="topbar"><div><strong id="issue-label">November 2026 · Issue 49</strong><small id="edition-counts"></small><small id="edition-state">Sign in to prepare your edition</small><small id="save-state" hidden></small></div></div>
<section class="shared" id="signin-panel"><h1>Your Editor Studio</h1><p>Sign in to build a monthly edition or Toshali Anthology 2027. Add poems or articles, arrange them, preview, then send for review.</p></section><p id="cloud-status" class="account-status" role="status" tabindex="-1">Checking shared workspace availability…</p>
<section id="studio-overview" class="shared" hidden tabindex="-1"><h1>Editor Studio</h1><p>Choose a publication to continue editing.</p><div class="actions"><button id="overview-monthly" type="button">Kabita Live</button><button id="overview-anthology" type="button">Toshali Anthology</button></div><h2>Published issues</h2><p id="overview-stat-status" role="status"></p><button id="overview-refresh" type="button">Refresh statistics</button><div id="issue-statistics" class="issue-statistics"></div></section><section class="shared" id="publication-picker" hidden><div class="publication-tabs" role="group" aria-label="Publication"><button id="publication-monthly" type="button" aria-pressed="true">Kabita Live</button><button id="publication-anthology" type="button" aria-pressed="false">Toshali Anthology</button></div></section>
<section class="shared" id="submission-desks" hidden><details id="submission-overview"><summary>Pending Submissions</summary><p>All submitted poems for this publication. Open the review desk to review or filter by decision.</p><section id="monthly-inbox" aria-label="Kabita Live submissions"><p>Poets and poems received for the monthly journal. Editors assign the issue month.</p><p id="monthly-inbox-status" role="status"></p><ul id="monthly-inbox-list"></ul><div class="actions"><button id="monthly-inbox-refresh" type="button">Refresh Monthly Kabita list</button><button id="monthly-inbox-more" type="button" hidden>Show more Monthly Kabita submissions</button><a href="monthly-review.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open Monthly Kabita review desk (new tab)</a></div></section><section id="anthology-inbox" aria-label="Toshali Anthology submissions" hidden><p>Toshali Anthology of Poetry 2027 · a separate collection from the monthly journal.</p><p id="anthology-inbox-status" role="status"></p><ul id="anthology-inbox-list"></ul><div class="actions"><button id="anthology-inbox-refresh" type="button">Refresh Anthology 2027 list</button><button id="anthology-inbox-more" type="button" hidden>Show more Anthology 2027 submissions</button><a href="toshali-review.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open Anthology 2027 review desk (new tab)</a></div></section></details></section>
<section class="shared" id="management" hidden><p class="studio-links"><a href="editor-management.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Comments &amp; statistics</a> · <a href="archive.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View published issues</a></p><details hidden><summary id="shared-heading">Internal draft tools</summary><p><a href="editor-management.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Comments &amp; statistics</a> · <a href="archive.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View published issues</a></p><div class="actions"><label class="open">Restore a backup<input id="open" type="file" accept=".json,application/json"></label><button id="download">Download backup</button><button id="cloud-logout" type="button" hidden>Sign out</button></div><div id="cloud-controls" hidden><form method="post" action="#" id="cloud-month-form"><label for="cloud-month">Open another month · YYYY-MM</label><input id="cloud-month" name="month" value="2026-11" pattern="20[0-9]{2}-(0[1-9]|1[0-2])" maxlength="7" required><button type="submit" id="cloud-open">Open edition</button></form><div class="actions"><button type="button" id="cloud-save">Save now</button><button type="button" id="cloud-import">Add selected submissions</button><button type="button" id="cloud-history">View saved history</button><button type="button" id="recover-copies">Recover an unfinished copy</button></div><ul id="cloud-revisions"></ul><div id="recovery-list"></div></div><details class="handoff"><summary>Production tools</summary><ul id="blockers"></ul><button id="handoff">Download production package</button><p>Production checks and Ahimanikya’s website approval follow editorial review.</p></details></details></section>
<section id="reconcile" class="shared" hidden tabindex="-1" aria-labelledby="reconcile-heading"><h2 id="reconcile-heading">Choose which edition to continue</h2><p>Another version is available. Compare both below. Both copies are retained in this browser session. The latest shared version also remains in saved history. Choosing your copy replaces the current shared edition after saving.</p><div class="comparison"><div><label for="my-copy">My unfinished edition</label><textarea id="my-copy" readonly></textarea><button id="choose-mine">Continue with my edition</button></div><div><label for="shared-copy">Latest saved edition</label><textarea id="shared-copy" readonly></textarea><button id="choose-shared">Continue with latest saved edition</button></div></div></section>
<section id="import-preview" class="shared" hidden aria-labelledby="import-heading"><h2 id="import-heading">Review imported article</h2><p id="import-warning"></p><label for="import-text">Imported text · read-only preview</label><textarea id="import-text" name="importPreview" readonly></textarea><div class="actions"><button id="import-confirm" type="button">Add article to edition</button><button id="import-cancel" type="button">Cancel import</button></div></section>
<div class="studio" id="studio" hidden><aside class="pages" id="editor-sidebar"><h1>Your edition</h1><div class="add-content"><button id="add" type="button" class="primary">Add Poem</button><div hidden><button id="add-selected" type="button">Add selected monthly poems</button><label class="open">Upload Word or text<input id="article-import" name="articleFile" type="file" accept=".docx,.txt"></label><button id="add-article">Write an article</button></div></div><nav id="pages" aria-label="Edition pages"></nav></aside>
<main data-pagefind-ignore="all" id="canvas" tabindex="-1"><div class="canvas-tools"><button id="sidebar-toggle" type="button" aria-controls="editor-sidebar" aria-expanded="true">Hide menu</button><div class="actions" role="group" aria-label="Editing mode"><button id="edit-mode" aria-pressed="true">Edit</button><button id="preview-mode" aria-pressed="false">Preview whole edition</button></div><div class="actions"><button id="undo" disabled>Undo</button><button id="width" aria-pressed="false" hidden>Phone width</button></div></div><p id="mode-help"></p><p id="notice" role="status" tabindex="-1"></p><div id="paper" class="paper"></div><div class="page-footer"><span id="page-name"></span><span>Reading proof · final publication layout may differ</span></div></main>
<aside class="properties"><h2 id="properties-heading">Issue details</h2><div id="properties"></div></aside></div>
<form id="submit-review" method="post" action="#"></form><div class="device-actions" id="edition-actions" hidden aria-label="Edition actions"><span id="device-save-state" role="status">Opening edition…</span><button id="device-save" type="button" hidden>Try saving again</button><button type="submit" form="submit-review" class="primary">Send edition for review</button></div><noscript>This private editor requires JavaScript. No draft is submitted from this page.</noscript></body></html>